<title>NORWAY: Statoil shuts Veslefrikk field for mainten.</title>
<headline>Statoil shuts Veslefrikk field for mainten.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Den norske stats oljeselskap AS (Statoil) said on Tuesday it had shut down the North Sea Veslefrikk oilfield for scheduled maintenance.</p>
<p>The development, which produced an average 62,065 barrels per day in May, is planned to be closed until June 21.</p>
<p>-- Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
